 - Given ..., when ..., then ...
 
+The description is the requirement; comments are not. Anything product or
+design adds in a comment ("should", "must", "instead", a frame to follow) is
+copied into these criteria before the ticket moves to In Progress. After that,
+a new requirement is an edit to this section plus a comment saying it changed,
+never a comment alone. Dev builds against this section and QA verifies against
+it, so a requirement that is only in a comment will not be built or tested.
+
+## Ready for In Progress
